# Week 8 Bitemporal DraftKings NFL Simulation & MILP Portfolio Report

**Architecture:** `GSEFullSlateSimulator` (Enhanced Discrete DST + Student-$t$ $\nu=4$ Copula + NegBin Red-Zone TDs $\text{VMR}=1.87$ + Gamma Yardage + $+3$ Milestone Cliffs) $\to$ `simulate_dirichlet_multinomial_field` ($O=5,000$ Salary-Legal Rosters $\le \$50,000$) $\to$ `optimize_gpp_portfolio` (Sequential Covariance & Overlap-Constrained MILP)

